[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4263.91, "timestamp": "01:11:03", "text": "做吧，因为我不会做音乐。我正在做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4266.47, "timestamp": "01:11:06", "text": "游戏以及我一直热爱的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4268.87, "timestamp": "01:11:08", "text": "感觉像是后悔或内疚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4272.39, "timestamp": "01:11:12", "text": "感觉自己好像在玩游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4274.47, "timestamp": "01:11:14", "text": "我喜欢走捷径。我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4277.75, "timestamp": "01:11:17", "text": "走最难的路，而且经常慢吞吞的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4279.99, "timestamp": "01:11:19", "text": "现在应该努力而不是玩游戏或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4281.59, "timestamp": "01:11:21", "text": "反应内容或其他类似的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4284.31, "timestamp": "01:11:24", "text": "我不想那样。没错，游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4286.229, "timestamp": "01:11:26", "text": "东西都在那儿。所以从某种意义上说，当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4288.229, "timestamp": "01:11:28", "text": "看看我的内容之类的，你可能会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4291.99, "timestamp": "01:11:31", "text": "就像玩游戏一样，如果你看看……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4294.709, "timestamp": "01:11:34", "text": "从最古老的开始。是的。很可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4298.07, "timestamp": "01:11:38", "text": "玩游戏，做所有这些普通的油管主播的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4299.83, "timestamp": "01:11:39", "text": "正确的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4302.95, "timestamp": "01:11:42", "text": "是的，但从某种程度上说，我希望做的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4304.47, "timestamp": "01:11:44", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4307.99, "timestamp": "01:11:47", "text": "音乐相关的演唱会用品，好多好酷的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4311.75, "timestamp": "01:11:51", "text": "我想做的事情，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4315.189, "timestamp": "01:11:55", "text": "虚拟管（vtubing）是一种管道技术，它不像固定管道那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4318.95, "timestamp": "01:11:58", "text": "类型或小众领域，你可以做到"}]